he world?", "speech": 2.981}, {"start": 3.021, "end": 4.282, "text": "Not Apple, not Nvidia,", "speech": 4.242}, {"start": 4.282, "end": 6.122, "text": "not even an *oil company.", "speech": 5.942}, {"start": 6.122, "end": 8.123, "text": "This company is in your *pocket right now.", "speech": 8.103}, {"start": 8.123, "end": 9.484, "text": "Open your wallet\u2026", "speech": 9.063}, {"start": 9.484, "end": 10.564, "text": "*Visa, or Mastercard!", "speech": 10.424}, {"start": 10.564, "end": 13.665, "text": "Visa makes *50% net profit on every dollar it makes.", "speech": 13.545}, {"start": 13.665, "end": 15.206, "text": "Here's the *interesting part:", "speech": 14.886}, {"start": 15.206, "end": 17.847, "text": "Visa doesn't give you your debit or credit card. The *bank does.", "speech": 17.547}, {"start": 17.847, "end": 19.807, "text": "Visa doesn't give you a loan. The *bank does.", "speech": 19.687}, {"start": 19.807, "end": 22.328, "text": "No risk for Visa. *Easy *profits.", "speech": 22.228}, {"start": 22.328, "end": 23.429, "text": "They're like a *bridge.", "speech": 23.329}, {"start": 23.429, "end": 26.57, "text": "Wherever money moves in the world, it crosses *this *bridge.", "speech": 26.43}, {"start": 26.57, "end": 28.971, "text": "Every time you swipe your card, a small *fee.", "speech": 28.931}, {"start": 28.971, "end": 32.772, "text": "Every day, silently, *billions of transactions around the world, and they make profits from it.", "speech": 32.572}, {"start": 32.772, "end": 35.273, "text": "Dubai real estate has the same kind of *silent *opportunity:", "speech": 35.273}, {"start": 35.273, "end": 36.294, "text": "*commercial real estate.", "speech": 36.254}, {"start": 36.294, "end": 40.315, "text": "Invest 13 crores and earn up to *1.3 *crore in rent, in this project:", "speech": 40.275}, {"start": 40.315, "end": 42.076, "text": "*Christian *A. *Rockefeller Business Tower.", "speech": 41.956}, {"start": 42.076, "end": 45.097, "text": "400 metres, *87 *floors, on Sheikh Zayed Road.", "speech": 44.977}, {"start": 45.097, "end": 47.218, "text": "This is Dubai's *tallest *commercial tower.", "speech": 46.978}, {"start": 47.218, "end": 51.139, "text": "The world's first billionaire, the Rockefeller family's *sixth *generation, Christian Rockefeller is the brand.", "speech": 51.119}, {"start": 51.139, "end": 53.16, "text": "Easy *50-50 payment plan.", "speech": 53.02}, {"start": 53.16, "end": 55.161, "text": "Offices start from *13 *crores.", "speech": 54.8}, {"start": 55.161, "end": 57.561, "text": "If you want silent, massive profits like *Visa,", "speech": 57.481}, {"start": 57.561, "end": 59.302, "text": "this project should be on your *watch *list.", "speech": 59.002}, {"start": 59.302, "end": 61.563, "text": "For more information, comment *ROCKEFELLER", "speech": 61.563}, {"start": 61.563, "end": 63.124, "text": "or contact the number on screen.", "speech": 63.104}, {"start": 63.124, "end": 63.78, "text": "*I'll get in touch.", "speech": 63.664}], "headlines": [{"start": 0.259, "end": 2.848, "lines": ["WHICH", "*company?"], "kicker": "QUICK QUESTION", "y": 250, "align": "left"}, {"start": 22.328, "end": 26.42, "lines": ["A BRIDGE", "*for money"], "kicker": "THE NETWORK", "y": 250, "align": "left"}, {"start": 29.021, "end": 32.722, "lines": ["BILLIONS OF", "*transactions"], "kicker": "EVERY DAY", "y": 250, "align": "left"}, {"start": 32.825, "end": 36.294, "lines": ["COMMERCIAL", "*property"], "kicker": "DUBAI'S SILENT OPPORTUNITY", "y": 250, "align": "left"}], "cards": [{"type": "list", "start": 42.232, "end": 45.097, "title": "THE TOWER", "color": "#FFC940", "y": 300, "items": [{"at": 43.176, "text": "87 floors"}, {"at": 44.257, "text": "Sheikh Zayed Road"}]}, {"type": "list", "start": 45.338, "end": 47.218, "title": "DEVELOPER'S PLAN", "color": "#FFC940", "y": 300, "items": [{"at": 45.724, "text": "Dubai's tallest commercial tower"}]}, {"type": "count", "start": 49.038, "end": 50.88, "value": 6, "suffix": "th", 